// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// M G Prakash Catering — dish catalogue
//
// This file is intentionally JSON5, not JSON: it allows comments and trailing
// commas so it can be hand-edited. Do not rename it to .json.
//
// Every value below must come from the controlled vocabulary in lib/taxonomy.ts.
// Run `npm run validate:dishes` after editing — it will tell you exactly which
// line is wrong. A value outside the vocabulary produces a dish that no filter
// on the site can ever reach.
//
//   course        beverage | starter | tiffin | soup | main | rice | bread |
//                 side | accompaniment | dessert          (array, in menu order)
//   diet          vegetarian | non-vegetarian | egg
//   is_vegan      false if it contains ghee, butter, milk, curd, paneer or honey
//
// There is deliberately no is_jain or contains_onion_garlic here — do not add
// them back. Nearly any dish on this list can be cooked without onion and
// garlic or to Jain rules, so a fixed per-dish answer was wrong in both
// directions; the customer states the requirement as a note on their order
// instead. See the Diet block in lib/taxonomy.ts.
//
// Dish ids are permanent. `meal_dishes.dish_id` is a foreign key onto them, so
// renaming an id will break every past order that referenced that dish.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
